{
  "$Comment": [
    "A theme palette for build_room.py: the block each material slot of a room spec becomes. A slot names one block,",
    "a block in one of its states ({Block, State}), or a weighted list picked per cell by a stable hash, so a rebuild",
    "writes the same blocks. Copy this file with other blocks to re-skin every spec that uses these slots.",
    "A slot a player must use (a brazier, a rune, a lever, a skill lock) needs a block with a Use interaction, or the",
    "volume over it never hears the use; a lit and an unlit slot are best one block in two of its own states."
  ],
